{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vimeo/psalm/issues/171","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vimeo/psalm","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vimeo/psalm/issues/171/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vimeo/psalm/issues/171/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vimeo/psalm/issues/171/events","html_url":"https://github.com/vimeo/psalm/issues/171","id":236906437,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWUyMzY5MDY0Mzc=","number":171,"title":"Incorrect type evaluation with file error handling using \"or\"","user":{"login":"nickyr","id":1389687,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzODk2ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1389687?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickyr","html_url":"https://github.com/nickyr","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickyr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickyr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickyr/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickyr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickyr/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickyr/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickyr/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickyr/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickyr/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":486061586,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw0ODYwNjE1ODY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vimeo/psalm/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ee0701","default":true,"description":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2017-06-19T14:18:25Z","updated_at":"2017-06-20T17:25:41Z","closed_at":"2017-06-20T17:25:41Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Put this into getpsalm.org:\r\n\r\n```php\r\n<?php\r\n  \r\n$file = fopen('foo.txt', 'w') or exit('Unable to open file');\r\nfclose($file);\r\n```\r\n\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/1389687/27289488-17f24f2c-54d8-11e7-927e-105ccafb8130.png)\r\n\r\nBut that's wrong! If `$file` were false, it would have exited.\r\n\r\nSee example 1 on http://php.net/manual/en/function.exit.php for this unusual syntax. Perhaps psalm is unaware of [the difference between `||` and `or`](http://php.net/manual/en/language.operators.logical.php)? I didn't even know `or` was a thing...","closed_by":{"login":"muglug","id":2292638,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyOTI2Mzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2292638?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug","html_url":"https://github.com/muglug","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vimeo/psalm/issues/171/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vimeo/psalm/issues/171/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}